{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Functional Driving Mechanics</strong>: Mechanics put together by someone who has at least read about cars, and knows they are large and go fast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Insane Tracks</strong>: From loop-de-loops to dodging tipped RVs, every course is a test of how well you can handle your ride and anticipate the insane race organizer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rogue NPC Competitors</strong>: Your rivals race as if they're all trying to make it home from the bar before their wives wake up. Cars will be dented, walls will be scraped, there's a respawn mechanic for a reason.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Series of Ridiculous Cars</strong>: Collect a motley series of vehicles to race with, ranging from &quot;Cars I wanted as a middle-schooler&quot; to &quot;The worst possible racer I can conceive of.&quot; </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So buckle up (seriously, safety first) and get ready to race like you\u2019ve never raced before.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3459330?t=1746927041","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3459330?t=1746927041","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459330/52221c528aacc26e668954594f0a9cfd15e2b731/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746927041","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459330/52221c528aacc26e668954594f0a9cfd15e2b731/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746927041","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Functional Driving Mechanics</strong>: Mechanics pu